      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.42,
      "end_seconds": 47.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "Mm, uh, it usually comes with ringing in the ears. As for ringing in the ears, honestly, once or twice a day."
