    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.91,
      "end_seconds": 141.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "mm-hmm. Any facial weakness or ear pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.06,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Right, I haven't had facial weakness or ear pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.28,
      "end_seconds": 152.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.66,
      "end_seconds": 156.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.89,
      "end_seconds": 158.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.54,
      "end_seconds": 174.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.36,
      "end_seconds": 204.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, respiratory rate 17, BP is 118 over 72, pulse is 68 beats a minute, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.94,
      "end_seconds": 206.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.79,
      "end_seconds": 211.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.75,
      "end_seconds": 217.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.68,
      "end_seconds": 218.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.54,
      "end_seconds": 223.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "stay as you are for a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.63,
      "end_seconds": 242.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Both ear drums look normal and the tuning fork is heard better through the bone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.06,
      "end_seconds": 257.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So where does that leave us? The most likely explanation is a conductive hearing loss, possibly otosclerosis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.7,
      "end_seconds": 261.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.64,
      "end_seconds": 272.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like a conductive hearing loss, possibly otosclerosis, but I'd like to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.57,
      "end_seconds": 293.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.02,
      "text": "I'm going to to order a hearing test, for hearing loss let's review you after the tests that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.53,
      "end_seconds": 301.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining"
